from name ../../module/reviewer_circle.pya to name reviewer circle be import do

exists su name author prompter ob text "Draft a concise answer for TASK. If review feedback is present, apply it exactly and fix factual issues." be text ya
exists su name author be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name author prompter ya

exists su name input ob text "Write a short greeting." be text ya

ob name text input for name text author by name text review mind brief atleast num 0.8 atmost num 3 to name text output be reviewer circle reviewer trying do
ob name output be write do
